# Perilous Landscape: "{T}, Sacrifice this land: Search your library for a basic Island, Mountain, or Plains card, put it
# onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle." A Tundra has the Plains and Island types but is not basic (CR 205.4a), so it
# is not a card the search may find; the Island is, and enters tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Perilous Landscape
Forest x6
Island x2
Tundra
Mountain
Plains
Forest x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Perilous Landscape.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Perilous Landscape.Activate(Ability: {T}, Sacrifice this land)
! Bot1.Search(Tundra)
Bot1.Search(Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Perilous Landscape
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = true
